{"key":"GalleryWindow","text":"## GalleryWindow\n\nThe **Gallery Window** is an image browser for setting desktop wallpapers.\n\n---\n\n@layout\nTitle Bar | 0.50, 0.04 | Right-click to rename or access options. The Gallery is an image browser for desktop wallpapers.\nImage Grid | 0.50, 0.55 | Scrollable grid of wallpaper thumbnails. Hover for name and resolution tooltip. Drag a thumbnail to the desktop background to set it as the wallpaper, or right-click → Set as Wallpaper.\n\n---\n\n### Setting a Wallpaper\n\n**Method 1 — Drag and drop:**\n1. Click and hold an image thumbnail\n2. A ghost icon follows your cursor with a **+** badge\n3. Drag to the desktop background area\n4. Release to set as wallpaper\n\n**Method 2 — Right-click:**\n1. Right-click an image thumbnail\n2. Choose **Set as Wallpaper**\n\n---\n\n### Image Thumbnails\n\n- Thumbnails load asynchronously from the background manifest\n- Hover over a thumbnail to see the image **name** and **resolution** in a tooltip\n- Images are sourced from `StreamingAssets/Backgrounds/`\n\n---\n\n### Right-Click Menu\n\n- **Set as Wallpaper** — apply this image as the desktop background\n- **Close Gallery** — close the window\n\n---","screenshot":""}